    "detailed_description": "This is a party-board race game. <br />\r\nYour goal is to compete with your rivals and win the race.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use various cards to trap your rivals and gain advantages for yourself;<br />\r\nYou can allocate your energy to roll a move dice. If your energy is out, you will be forced to take a rest.<br />\r\nAlso, there are different special cells in the race map, such as Teleport Cell / Change Position Cell / Random Event Cell etc.<br />\r\nMake a full use of these special cells will  help you a lot in the race!<br />\r\nThe winner of the game, which is one of the aliens\uff0c will get the battery and take the UFO to get away from the earth!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can either choose to play alone nor compete with your friends / other players online. <br />\r\nHope you can spend a fun time during playing!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a party-board race game. <br />\r\nYour goal is to compete with your rivals and win the race.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use various cards to trap your rivals and gain advantages for yourself;<br />\r\nYou can allocate your energy to roll a move dice. If your energy is out, you will be forced to take a rest.<br />\r\nAlso, there are different special cells in the race map, such as Teleport Cell / Change Position Cell / Random Event Cell etc.<br />\r\nMake a full use of these special cells will  help you a lot in the race!<br />\r\nThe winner of the game, which is one of the aliens\uff0c will get the battery and take the UFO to get away from the earth!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can either choose to play alone nor compete with your friends / other players online. <br />\r\nHope you can spend a fun time during playing!",
    "short_description": "This is a board game. Your goal is to defeat your rivals and win the battery. Then you can get on the UFO.",
